ue the possible relationship between Yaḥyā’s doctrine and his Miaphysite predecessors, who in the sixth century had to face the so-called 'Tritheism' of John Philoponus (d. 570) and his followers.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
